# Ghidra lock files
*.lock
*.lock~

# Ghidra scratch inside the project database. These are transient: Ghidra
# deletes and recreates them as it saves, so a commit catches whatever happened
# to be on disk. tmp*.ps is a FULL copy of the database - 12.9 MB of the 39 MB
# a snapshot used to cost - and the one that was committed had already been
# deleted by Ghidra before anyone pushed it.
#
# If a fresh clone ever fails to open the project, these are the first thing to
# un-ignore; nothing else here depends on them.
ghidra/**/tmp*.ps
ghidra/**/*.grf

# ignore the game folder
English Translated Version 1.1 (D)/

# Temporary files
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

